    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paper Knight is a <strong>2.5D Fantasy Platformer</strong> set in a <strong>beautiful paper crafted world</strong>, based in the <strong>catalan legend of the Saint George</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slash</strong>, <strong>jump</strong> and <strong>run</strong> your way through the land, and face a variety of <strong>levels</strong> and <strong>bosses</strong> to defeat the <strong>dragon</strong> and save the day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An aesthetic made of paper arts and crafts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ platform levels with a unique boss in the end</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A history based on the myths of Catalan folklore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable power-ups for each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original orchestral soundtrack for each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A central hub to unlock secrets and buy upgrades for your character</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paper Knight is a <strong>2.5D Fantasy Platformer</strong> set in a <strong>beautiful paper crafted world</strong>, based in the <strong>catalan legend of the Saint George</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slash</strong>, <strong>jump</strong> and <strong>run</strong> your way through the land, and face a variety of <strong>levels</strong> and <strong>bosses</strong> to defeat the <strong>dragon</strong> and save the day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An aesthetic made of paper arts and crafts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ platform levels with a unique boss in the end</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A history based on the myths of Catalan folklore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable power-ups for each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original orchestral soundtrack for each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A central hub to unlock secrets and buy upgrades for your character</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Paper Knight is a 2.5D Fantasy Platformer set in a beautiful paper crafted world, based in the catalan legend of the Saint George. Slash, jump and run your way through the land, and face a variety of levels and bosses to defeat the dragon and save the day!",
